#N canvas 120 60 820 420 12;
#X text 20 10 fs_drone <name> <root_midi> - drone for a raw-IMU sensor: tilt (10..150 deg) picks the pitch \; rotation speed (gyro_mag) sets loudness (30..400 deg/s) and brightness (0..600 deg/s) \, so it is silent when you hold still. Inlet: scale messages. Sound lives in fs_drone_voice., f 100;
#X obj 20 110 fs_in \$1 tilt;
#X obj 20 140 fs_map 10 150 0 1;
#X obj 300 110 fs_in \$1 gyro_mag;
#X obj 300 150 fs_map 30 400 0 1;
#X obj 480 150 fs_map 0 600 0 1;
#X obj 20 230 fs_drone_voice \$2;
#X obj 20 270 outlet~;
#X obj 160 110 inlet;
#X connect 1 0 2 0;
#X connect 2 0 6 0;
#X connect 3 0 4 0;
#X connect 3 0 5 0;
#X connect 4 0 6 1;
#X connect 5 0 6 2;
#X connect 6 0 7 0;
#X connect 8 0 6 0;
